{"uid":"f04dd05af60e5aee","name":"test_the_pin_holds_for_targets_outside_the_repo_via_the_plugin_path","fullName":"tests.test_tests_conftest_resolution#test_the_pin_holds_for_targets_outside_the_repo_via_the_plugin_path","historyId":"20cb0a5b616f1b2f17a669d33937d700","time":{"start":1791881187893,"stop":1791881189769,"duration":1876},"description":"The second load path, and the reason `tests_package_pin.py` is a module\n    rather than code inside `/conftest.py`.\n\n    pytest loads only the conftests on the path to the arguments it is given, so\n    `pytest /tmp/probe/test_x.py` -- even with this repository as the working\n    directory -- never loads `/conftest.py`, and the pin never runs. That is not\n    hypothetical: `scripts/host_like_pytest.sh` runs exactly such a probe (it is\n    the only way a test can observe the environment the script assembles), and\n    an installed `tests` package in site-packages is on `sys.path` for every\n    invocation regardless of what is being collected.\n\n    `-p tests_package_pin` closes it: pytest imports plugin modules before any\n    conftest. The mutation pair below is the whole point -- without the flag the\n    same command resolves `tests.conftest` to the decoy.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The second load path, and the reason <code>tests_package_pin.py</code> is a module<br />\nrather than code inside <code>/conftest.py</code>.</p>\n<pre><code>pytest loads only the conftests on the path to the arguments it is given, so\n`pytest /tmp/probe/test_x.py` -- even with this repository as the working\ndirectory -- never loads `/conftest.py`, and the pin never runs. That is not\nhypothetical: `scripts/host_like_pytest.sh` runs exactly such a probe (it is\nthe only way a test can observe the environment the script assembles), and\nan installed `tests` package in site-packages is on `sys.path` for every\ninvocation regardless of what is being collected.\n\n`-p tests_package_pin` closes it: pytest imports plugin modules before any\nconftest. The mutation pair below is the whole point -- without the flag the\nsame command resolves `tests.conftest` to the decoy.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791880795037,"stop":1791880795037,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791880795038,"stop":1791880795038,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791881187832,"stop":1791881187832,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791881187833,"stop":1791881187853,"duration":20},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791881187854,"stop":1791881187854,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791881187854,"stop":1791881187876,"duration":22},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791881187876,"sto